+`COMMITTED` in this historical state machine means that the corresponding
+World Kernel atomic commit actually occurred and its receipt is validated.
+`RECOVERED` may describe verified recovery evidence without claiming an
+authoritative World update; a RecoveryReceipt is not a WORLD_COMMIT_RECEIPT.
+Failed and UNKNOWN states remain factual history and cannot enter the
+successful modeled-World outcome path without the same exact-parent commit.
